        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 14. Ending your use -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">14. Ending your use</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          You can stop using PantryPal at any time by deleting it (remember to cancel any subscription in your store account). We may suspend or end your licence if you seriously or repeatedly break these Terms. Sections 4, 9 and 11 to 17 continue to apply after your use ends.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 15. Apple App Store terms -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">15. Apple App Store terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If you downloaded PantryPal from the Apple App Store, the following also applies:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
